<title>USA: Arch Communications Q3 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Arch Communications Q3 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBOROROUGH, Mass. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arch Communications Group, Inc.</p>
<p>				  Financial Highlights</p>
<p>(In thousands, except for subscriber units, share and per share data)</p>
<p>			  Three Months Ended    Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				 Sept. 30,		Sept. 30,</p>
<p>			   1996	 1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net revenues (a) $84,719     $35,544    $217,307     $84,054</p>
<p> Total EBITDA (b)  29,161	11,613	75,519	25,945</p>
