<p>(a) Net revenues are the sum of service, rental and maintenance revenues, plus product sales, less cost of products sold.</p>
<p>(b) EBITDA is Earnings Before Interest, Taxes, Depreciation and Amortization.</p>
<p>(c) Margin is EBITDA divided by net revenues.</p>
<p>(d) Extraordinary charge from early extinguishment of debt represented the write-off of unamortized deferred financing costs associated with the prepayment of indebtedness under prior credit facilities.</p>
